#!/usr/bin/env beg

Accept a test command and its arguments. Run it in the current directory and
forward stdout and stderr live to their corresponding streams.

For Cargo or Rust test harness output, append one section per failing test to
stderr after the run. Include its full failure output and a shell-quoted
command that reruns just that test in the correct test target.

Keep the original command's exit status, including when a build fails before
any tests run.
